error: `writeLine` on a file holds the thread until it is done, and an async function does not hold its thread
  the tasks of async functions share a few threads: one that holds its thread keeps the others from running
  --> error_async_writer_blocking.sg:5:11
 5 |     try w.writeLine("one")
   |           ^^^^^^^^^
  hint: `await w.writeLineAsync("one")` does the same work without holding the thread
